														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-4863094">
									

<p>In the Foundation Universe, there are two SCP's that have always drawn my attention. SCP-073 and SCP-076-2. Both have strong implications that they are Cain and Abel from the Book Of Genesis. Now, in the Foundation Universe, I've seen some evidence of other Genesis characters, such as Adam and Eve (O5-1) and Lilith. However, I can't find any evidence of Seth, the third son of A&amp;E. Is there an SCP or Tale involving him or has he yet to enter/be discovered in the Foundation World?</p>

