<p>What is the canon behind the assignment of numbers to objects?<br />
The foundation has a large number of objects that they contain/monitor with some files being as recent as a year while others dating back decades. There seems to be no particular chronological order to the numbers assigned to a given SCP (ie a 5th series scp could be in the foundations possession since the 70's while one of the original 1st series could only date back to the early 2000's . Now obviously this just a by product of how the out-of-universe site operates, but I was wondering if there was an in-universe explanation for this. Any additional info on the subject is welcome as well :)</p>

